,245.27,1435.51,245.21Z"/><path fill="white" d="M1445.42,243.93c.07-.13-3.46-5.41-2.84-5.36a16.33,16.33,0,0,1,2.52.08l2.06,3.87h.09l2.11-3.87a.16.16,0,0,1,.13-.08c.08.09,2.82-.23,2.49.22,0,.15-3.17,5-3,5.19l3.14,5.42c.34.45-2.52.14-2.58.22a.15.15,0,0,1-.13-.07l-2.16-4.07h-.12l-2.28,4.07a.14.14,0,0,1-.12.07h-2.38C1441.72,249.51,1445.63,244.23,1445.42,243.93Z"/></g></svg></span>
